Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}Did you know that a single\Nbolt of lightning can be\Nhotter than the surface of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.36,0:00:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}the sun?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.36,0:00:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}It’s true!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.36,0:00:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}Imagine being outside\Nduring a storm
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.36,0:00:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}You might see a flash of\Nlightning in the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.08,0:00:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}That lightning is like a giant\Nelectric spark
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.26,0:00:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}Now
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.57,0:00:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}think about a campfire
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.26,0:00:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}It’s warm and bright
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.26,0:00:21.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}The sun is like a giant\Ncampfire in the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.93,0:00:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}keeping us all warm
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.08,0:00:26.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}But here’s the surprising\Npart: that quick flash of\Nlightning is even hotter!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.63,0:00:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}It’s as if the lightning is\Nwearing a special hot coat
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.66,0:00:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}making it super warm for
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.99,0:00:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}just a moment
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.99,0:00:35.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}Lightning happens when tiny\Nparticles in clouds bump\Ninto each other
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.99,0:00:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}It’s like when you rub your\Nhands together really fast to\Nget warm
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.53,0:00:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}This makes the clouds full of\Nenergy and creates that\Nbright zigzag we see in
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.62,0:00:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}the sky
